# Mobile dialogs

Use **`CustomDialog`** from `@webonone/mobile-ui` for create/edit/confirm flows in the Expo app.

Related: [mobile-ui-consumption.mdc](mobile-ui-consumption.mdc), [form-creation skill](../skills/form-creation/SKILL.md).

**Do not** use web [dialog-windows.mdc](dialog-windows.mdc) or [core-hosted-peer-dialog](../skills/core-hosted-peer-dialog/SKILL.md) — there is no iframe parent on native.

## API

| Prop | Role |
|------|------|
| `open` / `onOpenChange` | Controlled visibility |
| `title`, `description`, `icon` | Header content |
| `footer` | Cancel / primary actions (host owns footer in the dialog component) |
| `sizeWidth`, `sizeHeight` | Presets: `small`, `medium`, `large`, `xlarge`, `auto` |

Also available: `ConfirmDialog` for destructive confirms.

## Patterns

- Form dialogs: fields in dialog body; submit in `footer`; validation errors inline via `FormField`.
- Wizards: one step per dialog open state or separate screens — no peer-dialog bridge.
- Selection: `UserSelectionDialog`, `TagSelectionDialog` from mobile-ui.

